## AV Built for Match Day: Announcer Sound and Scoreboard Displays

A sports event is not a conference room. The announcer PA has to carry over crowd noise across an open pitch, track or court, and the visual needs are usually a scoreboard or presentation screen rather than a slide deck.

Our PA sound systems and wired, wireless or gooseneck microphones cover announcer duty, team introductions and sponsor speeches. Our 60 inch LED display or 5000 lumen laser projector and screen handle live scores, replays or sponsor branding.

For our full audio visual rental range, see the [audio visual rental page](/blog/audio-visual-rental/).

