## Staging for Medal Ceremonies and Team Walkouts

The moment that gets remembered from a tournament is usually the ceremony, not the match itself. Our modular staging and methacrylate lectern give you a real podium for medal presentations and opening remarks, and our smoke machine adds a proper entrance for a team walkout or ceremony opening.

## Outdoor Setups: What Actually Travels to the Pitch or Track

Most sports events happen outdoors, and our PA sound, lighting and staging are all designed to travel to a pitch, court or track. Power at outdoor grounds is the real constraint to plan around: confirm what mains power is available at your venue when you book, so we can size the setup correctly.

