## FAQs

### How much does audio visual rental cost for a sports event?

Pricing depends on the package: our full catalog, from the Basic MICE Pack for a club event up to the MICE Pack for a full tournament, is listed with exact euro pricing on our [packages page](/packages/). All rates are ex VAT, with 21 percent Spanish VAT added at checkout, and every price includes delivery, setup and teardown.

### What AV equipment do I need for a sports event's announcer PA?

An announcer PA needs active PA sound reinforcement sized to carry over crowd noise, plus a wired, wireless or gooseneck microphone for the announcer or match commentator. See [AV Built for Match Day](#av-built-for-match-day-announcer-sound-and-scoreboard-displays) above.

### Can outdoor sports events use the same AV equipment as indoor venues?

Our PA sound, lighting and staging all travel to outdoor pitches, courts and tracks. The real constraint is power: tell us what mains power is available at your outdoor venue when you book, so we can size the setup correctly. See [Outdoor Setups](#outdoor-setups-what-actually-travels-to-the-pitch-or-track) above.

### Do you provide microphones for match commentary or medal ceremonies?

Yes. We provide wired, wireless and gooseneck microphones for match commentary, team introductions and sponsor speeches, plus a methacrylate lectern for medal ceremonies and opening remarks.

### What size screen or projector is best for a sports event?

Our 60 inch LED display suits a team area or smaller venue; our 5000 lumen laser projector and screen suit a larger outdoor viewing area. Tell us your venue size when you book and we will match the right screen.

### Is a smoke machine available for team walkouts or ceremony openings?

Yes, our smoke machine is available as an add on for team walkouts and ceremony openings. See [Staging for Medal Ceremonies and Team Walkouts](#staging-for-medal-ceremonies-and-team-walkouts) above.

### How far in advance should I book AV equipment for a sports event?

Book as early as you can once your event date and venue are confirmed, especially for a tournament with a ceremony on a fixed schedule. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during the spring and autumn sports season.

### What sports events has Malaga Event Gear worked on before?

We delivered the full lights and sound setup for the Billie Jean King Cup 2024, including the awards ceremony. See the [Case Study](#case-study-billie-jean-king-cup-2024) above.
